To run the code nevigate to terminal and give commands 

$ $ g++ -o twoPass twoPass.cpp
$ $ ./twoPass

File description
1. twoPass.cpp : Implementation of two pass assembler 
2. intermediate.txt : This will contain the intermediate code generated after first pass
3. machineCode.txt : This is for reference that source code is converted to correct object code (each instruction's hex correspondance)
4. output.txt : This contain the final .obj file of the given assembly code
5. symbolTable.txt : Contains the symbol table generated in pass one

